      "title": {
        "en": "Crisp breed trims and refreshing baths"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients consistently praise the high visual quality of grooming services, describing dogs and long-haired cats coming home neatly styled, smelling fresh, and free of tangled mats. While two reviewers complained of uneven trims and long wait times, most praise the skillful scissor work."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 21,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle handling for puppies and dogs"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners appreciate the patient care extended to first-time puppies, nervous rescues, and large breeds such as Samoyeds and Great Pyrenees. Most pets leave feeling relaxed after spa treatments, though one client reported a severe nail and anal gland issue that required veterinary care."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 15,
      "title": {
        "en": "Friendly grooming crew with billing disputes"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Groomers Emily, Maria, and Carolina receive frequent praise for their courteous communication, attentive styling notes, and warm demeanor. A few dissenting reviews mention price discrepancies at pickup and long waiting times, but the overwhelming consensus highlights caring customer service."
      }
    }
  ],
